WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:03.039
A message can be received without being approved or

00:00:03.105 --> 00:00:08.645
completed After identifying roles follow the information moving between

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:14.000
them A read receipt can feel reassuring Yet colleagues

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.395
may still be waiting for a decision or working

00:00:16.421 --> 00:00:20.474
from an earlier attachment We will connect clear status

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:23.855
messages to the controlled record so affected people know

00:00:23.974 --> 00:00:25.092
what they can act on
